# Built output. It is a 2 MB single file, mostly base64 map data, so every
# rebuild would be a 2 MB diff. Build it with `npm run build`, or download it
# from the Releases page, or just use the hosted copy on GitHub Pages.
drop-solver.html

# Full-resolution map sources. map_embed.jpg and og_map_embed.jpg are the cut
# down versions the build actually inlines; the PNGs they came from are 10 MB
# and nothing in the build reads them.
map.png
map_41.png
og_map.png

